{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"y equals 7,400 left parenthesis 0.87 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn><msup><mfenced><mn>0.87</mn></mfenced><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation estimates the value, in dollars, of a certain piece of equipment <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> years after it was purchased. According to the given equation, what was the estimated value, in dollars, of the piece of equipment at the time it was purchased?</p>", "keys": ["f8fa97d5-e6bf-4230-b9a0-a6faf5c7f661"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "8fec081f-8652-4511-b22f-c7c747039ca7", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"740\"><mn>740</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "ac4f6c60-89d5-481e-bf54-b13861d36c16", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"6,438\"><mn>6,438</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "f8fa97d5-e6bf-4230-b9a0-a6faf5c7f661", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"7,400\"><mn>7,400</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "ad8d30ff-780c-4142-b57d-d97490e29bea", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"8,700\"><mn>8,700</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. It&rsquo;s given that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 7,400 left parenthesis 0.87 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msup></math> estimates the value, in dollars, of a certain piece of equipment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> years after it was purchased. The estimated value of the piece of equipment at the time it was purchased corresponds to the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y\"><mi>y</mi></math> when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x equals 0\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. Substituting <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"0\"><mn>0</mn></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi></math> in the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 7,400 left parenthesis 0.87 right parenthesis Superscript x\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msup></math> yields <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 7,400 left parenthesis 0.87 right parenthesis Superscript 0\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>0.87</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>0</mn></msup></math>, which is equivalent to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 7,400 left parenthesis 1 right parenthesis\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math>, or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"y equals 7,400\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7,400</mn></math>. Therefore, the estimated value, in dollars, of the piece of equipment at the time it was purchased was <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"7,400\"><mn>7,400</mn></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This was the estimated value, in dollars, of the piece of equipment <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn></math> year after it was purchased.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "94ede15a-23c9-4c00-bcde-09c2bb206b79", "correct_answer": ["C"]}